00:02:35.394 --> 00:02:37.963
<i>When I was a
kid, in the summer,</i>


00:02:37.996 --> 00:02:39.965
<i>I would go up
into northern Canada</i>


00:02:39.999 --> 00:02:42.802
<i>with my father
and two brothers fishing.</i>


00:02:42.834 --> 00:02:45.337
<i>The one male bonding
thing we did.</i>


00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.874
<i>And the only extravagance my
rather workaholic, miserly good,</i>


00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:52.044
<i>country-boy father
could muster.</i>


00:02:52.077 --> 00:02:56.415
<i>We flew by bush plane,
small planes with pontoons,</i>


00:02:56.448 --> 00:02:59.818
<i>into a wilderness lake where we
would be met by an old trapper</i>


00:02:59.851 --> 00:03:02.021
<i>who lived there year-round.</i>


00:03:02.054 --> 00:03:05.357
<i>He hadn't been back
to civilization for 20 years,</i>


00:03:05.391 --> 00:03:11.298
<i>and communicated with the fish camp
organizers on a shortwave radio.</i>


00:03:11.331 --> 00:03:14.900
<i>Once we got to his camp,
a group of small cabins</i>


00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:16.936
<i>nestled around
his little house,</i>


00:03:16.969 --> 00:03:19.005
<i>with the sides
stacked head high</i>


00:03:19.037 --> 00:03:21.774
<i>with a mountain of dried bone.</i>


00:03:21.808 --> 00:03:26.379
<i>Behind, there were teepees with
a small group of Cree Indians</i>


00:03:26.411 --> 00:03:30.082
<i>who would take us out
on the water and be our guides.</i>


00:03:30.115 --> 00:03:36.655
<i>They had names like Tom Pitt,
Rod Rat, Billy Deer.</i>


00:03:36.689 --> 00:03:40.327
<i>All toothless, passive,
and alcoholic.</i>


00:03:40.359 --> 00:03:43.730
<i>However, they were not allowed
liquor while they worked.</i>


00:03:43.762 --> 00:03:47.367
<i>Although their eyes always were
an angry, bloodshot red,</i>


00:03:47.399 --> 00:03:50.035
<i>so maybe they were
sneaking drinks.</i>


00:03:50.068 --> 00:03:53.606
<i>They truly were
romantic figures gone to seed.</i>


00:03:53.638 --> 00:03:56.041
<i>Anyway, the point.</i>


00:03:56.075 --> 00:03:58.911
<i>At this camp,
there was a group of huskies</i>


00:03:58.945 --> 00:04:02.349
<i>that that trapper kept for his
dogsled for work in the winter.</i>


00:04:02.381 --> 00:04:04.083
<i>It wasn't until
we stopped going</i>


00:04:04.117 --> 00:04:07.519
<i>that this guy got rid of them
for a snowmobile.</i>


00:04:07.553 --> 00:04:12.058
<i>These dogs were sweet,
but wild enough to be scary.</i>


00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:16.395
<i>The biggest manhood challenge
for me at six years old</i>


00:04:16.429 --> 00:04:18.798
<i>was running from our cabin
to the outhouse,</i>


00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:22.568
<i>because the dogs would chase
you and nip at your heels.</i>


00:04:22.601 --> 00:04:24.637
<i>While you were in the outhous,</i>


00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:27.107
<i>they would scratch at the door
and growl.</i>


00:04:27.139 --> 00:04:28.808
<i>Horrific.</i>


00:04:28.841 --> 00:04:31.778
<i>And then,
when you were through,</i>


00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:34.147
<i>you'd race back
to the safety of your cabin</i>


00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:37.451
<i>hoping the nips
wouldn't turn into bites.</i>


00:06:39.704 --> 00:06:40.940
Okay.


00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.243
Rum it is.


00:07:19.111 --> 00:07:21.947
Good.


00:07:32.892 --> 00:07:34.327
They're hungry.


00:09:03.214 --> 00:09:04.216
Sugar?


00:09:18.763 --> 00:09:19.798
Okay.


00:10:52.324 --> 00:10:54.928
Hey, can I get another one
of these when you get a chance?


00:11:01.834 --> 00:11:03.902
- How often you play?
- Never.


00:11:03.935 --> 00:11:05.738
- Why?
- I don't need to.


00:11:07.573 --> 00:11:10.243
- But you might win.
- I don't wanna win.


00:11:10.276 --> 00:11:11.377
Why?


00:11:13.344 --> 00:11:15.147
I don't wanna lose.


00:11:21.219 --> 00:11:22.220
- Oh.
- Okay.


00:11:22.253 --> 00:11:24.089
- Come on. Yep.
- Here we go.


00:11:24.123 --> 00:11:25.257
Ready...


00:11:30.528 --> 00:11:32.197
- There you go. There you go.
- Mm.


00:11:33.199 --> 00:11:34.567
- Come on.
- Come on.


00:11:34.599 --> 00:11:36.234
- Come on...
- Come on, baby.


00:11:36.267 --> 00:11:37.869
Come on.


00:13:53.504 --> 00:13:55.173
Shh.


00:13:55.206 --> 00:13:56.075
