00:13:58.074 --> 00:13:58.444
It's okay.


00:15:15.219 --> 00:15:16.654
Good?


00:22:47.972 --> 00:22:48.907
Mitchell?


00:23:05.023 --> 00:23:06.192
Mitchell?


00:26:05.170 --> 00:26:07.038
<i>I don't understand...</i>


00:26:09.173 --> 00:26:12.143
<i>how you can have anything to do
with someone like her.</i>


00:26:18.248 --> 00:26:19.884
Just because you
don't understand


00:26:19.918 --> 00:26:21.820
doesn't mean it cannot be.


00:26:23.488 --> 00:26:24.890
<i>But why?</i>


00:26:25.989 --> 00:26:28.059
That's the wrong question.


00:26:28.093 --> 00:26:30.262
The right question is,


00:26:30.295 --> 00:26:32.296
"Is this the way
of the world?"


00:26:32.330 --> 00:26:34.766
And the answer is yes.


00:26:34.798 --> 00:26:36.734
<i>What do you know?</i>


00:26:36.767 --> 00:26:39.336
<i>You don't live in the world.</i>


00:26:39.370 --> 00:26:43.007
<i>You stuck yourself at the
end of the universe in here.</i>


00:26:43.040 --> 00:26:48.179
<i>You can't see your selfishness,
arrogance, and above all, your ignorance.</i>


00:26:48.212 --> 00:26:52.149
<i>You pretend to be
open to all things</i>


00:26:52.182 --> 00:26:57.055
<i>but can't see
how closed-minded you are.</i>


00:26:57.087 --> 00:27:01.959
<i>Do you actually believe
you'll find your soul here?</i>


00:27:01.992 --> 00:27:04.062
My soul is within me.


00:27:06.430 --> 00:27:08.400
<i>Wrong again, brother.</i>


00:27:08.432 --> 00:27:12.136
<i>Your soul is outside of you,
and you must claim it.</i>


00:27:13.270 --> 00:27:14.405
I have.


00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:19.143
I began a journey
that finished here.


00:27:19.177 --> 00:27:21.480
<i>There is no beginning.</i>


00:27:21.513 --> 00:27:24.249
<i>There is no end.
That's babble.</i>


00:27:24.282 --> 00:27:27.352
<i>That's not the language
of the soul.</i>


00:27:27.384 --> 00:27:32.924
<i>Time will pass,
and you'll continue to be lost.</i>


00:27:34.124 --> 00:27:36.928
You sound like my father.


00:27:36.960 --> 00:27:40.364
<i>You complain that your father
didn't know you.</i>


00:27:40.398 --> 00:27:44.069
<i>He carried you on his back
through life,</i>


00:27:44.102 --> 00:27:49.341
<i>and all you can do is criticize
some oversights he committed,</i>


00:27:49.373 --> 00:27:52.911
<i>while you are guilty
of the biggest crimes.</i>


00:27:53.911 --> 00:27:55.313
Really?


00:27:55.345 --> 00:27:57.414
What crimes were those?


00:27:57.448 --> 00:27:59.051
<i>You tell me.</i>


00:28:00.852 --> 00:28:03.321
<i>No, instead you'd like
to hear it from my mouth</i>


00:28:03.353 --> 00:28:06.024
<i>so you can deny it.</i>


00:28:06.056 --> 00:28:10.027
<i>That's the same cowardly game
you played with your father.</i>


00:28:11.028 --> 00:28:12.530
I love my father.


00:28:12.564 --> 00:28:16.234
<i>You were not a loving son.</i>


00:28:16.267 --> 00:28:18.570
<i>You were a burden to him.</i>


00:28:18.603 --> 00:28:20.805
<i>And now to me.</i>


00:30:28.498 --> 00:30:33.704
<i>When I had been pondering many
different things to myself for a long time,</i>


00:30:33.738 --> 00:30:38.610
<i>and had for many days been seeking
my own self and what my own good was,</i>


00:30:38.642 --> 00:30:41.979
<i>and what evil
was to be avoided,</i>


00:30:42.013 --> 00:30:46.551
<i>there suddenly spoke to me...
What was it?</i>


00:30:46.584 --> 00:30:48.953
<i>I myself or someone else?</i>


00:30:48.987 --> 00:30:52.690
<i>Inside or outside me?</i>


00:30:52.723 --> 00:30:57.328
<i>This is the very thing I
would love to know, but don't.</i>


00:31:12.477 --> 00:31:13.946
No.


00:31:26.157 --> 00:31:27.159
Hup.


00:31:30.561 --> 00:31:32.297
Okay! Okay!


00:31:49.814 --> 00:31:51.149
Good dog.


