00:39:36.247 --> 00:39:37.949
The doctor...


00:40:13.951 --> 00:40:15.587
I'm glad you're here.


00:40:17.587 --> 00:40:18.922
Dad?


00:40:21.625 --> 00:40:23.561
I just gotta get some gear.


00:40:25.062 --> 00:40:26.130
